      <title>VS Code AI Chat 的 Agent 功能已能接手多步编码任务</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/VS-Code-AI-Chat-%E7%9A%84-Agent-%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E5%B7%B2%E8%83%BD%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%8B%E5%A4%9A%E6%AD%A5%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1/</link>
